```console
$ scherzo-cloud github setup complete --help
Complete browser-based GitHub setup

Usage: scherzo-cloud github setup complete [OPTIONS] --provider-installation-id <INSTALLATION_ID> <ORGANIZATION> <SETUP_SESSION>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>   Organization ID or exact slug
  <SETUP_SESSION>  GitHub setup session ID returned by setup begin

Options:
      --provider-installation-id <INSTALLATION_ID>
          Decimal GitHub installation ID returned after browser setup
      --json
          Print the GitHub result as JSON
      --allow-insecure-http
          Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help
          Print help

```
